# Generated runtime types (~600 KB). Produced by `npm run cf:types` from
# wrangler.jsonc, and regenerated in CI before every typecheck. Committing it
# would mean a stale copy silently contradicting the real bindings, which is the
# exact class of drift this file exists to prevent.
env.d.ts